    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this 3 bed semi detached property to the market for sale. \n\nThis property comes to the market in immaculate condition throughout having been meticulously well maintained by its current owners. This property offers an ample amount of bright and airy and spacious living accommodation and comprises of entrance hallway, kitchen/dining, pantry room, living room and guest wc all downstairs. Upstairs is the main family bathroom and 3 good sized bedrooms, the main of which is ensuite. The attic space has also been floored and wired for electricity providing additional storage space. The property features a highly functional covered lean-to providing excellent weather protected storage for bicycles, tools etc. with secure access from both the front and rear gardens. There is parking for a number of vehicles to the front of the property. \n\nTemple Mills is a modern development and is conveniently located only a short walk to Rathangan village. A host of excellent amenities can be found there including shops, schools, shops, takeways, pubs, church, community playground and much more. Rathangan also has a vibrant GAA and tennis club. Kildare Town is a little over 10km away which is home to the National Stud & Japanese Gardens and the ever popular Kildare Village Shopping Outlet. \n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, under stairs storage \n\nKitchen: Wooden flooring, light fitting, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, oven, hob, extractor fan, kitchen island, double doors leading to rear living room, access to utility room \n\nPantry Room: Tiled flooring, fully fitted shelving, back door leading to rear garden\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, feature fireplace with stove insert, double doors leading to dining area\n\nGuest WC: Tiled flooring, WHB, WC \n\nMaster Bedroom: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe, blinds \n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, corner shower unit, WHB, WC\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe, blinds \n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring, curtains, blinds\n\nAttic Conversion: Carpet flooring, recessed spot lights \n\nFamily Bathroom: Wooden flooring, tiled surround, bath, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket \n\nFeatures:\n\nWired for alarm\nComposite front door\nSelected carpets, curtains, blinds and light fittings included\nPVC double glazed windows \nOutside tap\nOutside light\nPatio area to rear\nCobble lock driveway \nSide gate entrance to rear garden\nAir to water heating system\nMains water\nMains sewage\nBuilt in 2019\nc.105.02sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
